      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im stuck on this iam thing. i tried to give my lambda function permission to write to an s3 bucket for some logs but im just getting access denied errors every single time. i thought i did it right but it wont work. here is the policy i'm using:\n\n{\n    \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n    \"Statement\": [\n        {\n            \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n            \"Action\": [\n                \"s3:PutObject\"\n            ],\n            \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:s3:::my-app-logs-bucket\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\ncan u look at this and tell me whats wrong?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
