      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your S3 policy looks syntactically correct, but the issue likely stems from the bucket name in the ARN not matching the actual name of your bucket (including trailing slashes or specific regions). Additionally, ensure your Lambda execution role’s trust policy explicitly lists `s3.amazonaws.com` as an allowed principal to grant the Lambda function the necessary permissions. Finally, verify you haven't accidentally restricted access through Bucket Policies or MFA appliance settings that might override the execution role.",
